// ============================================================
// STYLE 6: Flashcard Quiz Show  (template + demo topic)
// Topic: Capital Showdown - 5 capitals people get wrong
// Look: dark purple stage, ONE bold colored card per question, hard
//   offset shadow, big question -> countdown "think" beat -> answer
//   reveal + fun fact. Score stars and a 5-segment progress bar
//   run along the bottom of every scene.
// Beat per question: question | SAY | 3-2-1 | answer pops | fact
// Card colors: pink, orange, teal, yellow, blue (dark text on all).
// Reuse: swap question/answer/fact strings, keep geometry.
// ============================================================
VERSION 1.0
CANVAS 1920 1080
BACKGROUND #1B1340
BOARD plain
STYLE clean
FONT neat
STROKE 4
SUBTITLES off

